  "title": "Kaixin Holdings Announces Intended Acquisition of Honglu Technology to Optimize AI Applications",
  "summary": "BEIJING, Oct. 28, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Kaixin Holdings (“Kaixin” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: KXIN) today announced the signing of a term sheet to acquire Honglu Technology, a leading Chinese AI animation company. Kaixin plans to issue new shares to acquire a 51% stake in Honglu Technology.",
